[00:04.285]
[00:06.325]
[00:06.325]
[00:06.325]
[00:06.325]
[00:17.303]I open the window in the early morning
[00:20.862]Just another day
[00:24.598]Hope and hopelessness
[00:27.813]As always singing together
[00:31.914]In the face of death
[00:35.238]There is no victor
[00:38.318]Dawn disperses before the dark
[00:42.515]
[00:44.736]New fears left behind
[00:50.040]And old sorrows
[00:52.855]Along with abandoned thirsts
[00:58.889]Planting new perplexities
[01:04.089]And old exiles
[01:07.723]Along with the sounds of weeping mothers
[01:09.391]
[01:18.770]That shattered sunlight
[01:22.374]Brings me back home
[01:26.320]There is a window there
[01:29.362]That never extinguishes
[01:33.629]We youth
[01:36.675]Don’t understand what fate is
[01:40.363]Still surging and shouting out
[01:45.503]
[01:46.628]I’ve lost my lover
[01:50.950]Also my dampened faith
[01:54.494]And my absurd dreams
[02:00.080]Now we are getting old
[02:04.884]Still searching for eternity
[02:08.485]So that all will be forgiven
[02:14.220]We’re still looking
[02:18.839]For a promised liberation
[02:22.554]To use up the last of the insanity
[02:27.938]Lalala...
[03:00.223]
[03:42.057]Tonight I don’t know
[03:46.651]Where tomorrow lies
[03:50.594]But our language
[03:54.185]Will approach the answer in the end
[03:59.894]In the face of death
[04:02.403]There are no victors
[04:06.624]The sounds of last night’s gunshots
[04:09.456]Already forgotten
[04:15.842]
